13. LAMP Application Hosting

Execution Steps
1.Launch Linux EC2 instance
2.Install Apache, PHP, and MySQL
3.Configure application files
4.Connect application with database
5.Start Apache service
6.Open application in browser

Project Overview
Hosted a traditional LAMP stack application on AWS.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Amazon RDS
Apache
PHP
MySQL

Features
Traditional web hosting
Database integration
Stable application deployment

Architecture
Apache + PHP → MySQL Database
